{"title": "Time Thoroughly Bided", "pageid": 28256, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Time_Thoroughly_Bided", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Time Thoroughly Bided</b> is a passive feature that enhances the user's damage.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>The wearer gains <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Charge_(Condition)\" title=\"Arcane Charge (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Arcane_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Arcane_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Arcane_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Arcane_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Arcane_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Arcane_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arcane Charge\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Arcane_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Arcane_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Arcane_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Charge_(Condition)\" title=\"Arcane Charge (Condition)\">Arcane Charge</a> whenever they are hit by a melee attack. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Arcane_Charge\"> Condition: Arcane Charge </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Charge_(Condition)\" title=\"Arcane Charge (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Arcane_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Arcane_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Arcane_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Arcane_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Arcane_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Arcane_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arcane Charge\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Arcane_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Arcane_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Arcane_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Charge_(Condition)\" title=\"Arcane Charge (Condition)\">Arcane Charge</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>While damaging <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Threatened_(Condition)\" title=\"Threatened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Threatened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Threatened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Threatened_(Condition)\" title=\"Threatened (Condition)\">Threatened</a> entities, deal +2 bonus damage with spells.<sup><i>[<a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Charge_(Condition)#Bugs\" title=\"Arcane Charge (Condition)\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup></li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bided_Time\" title=\"Bided Time\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Bided_Time_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bided_Time_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Bided_Time_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Bided_Time_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Bided_Time_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Bided_Time_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Bided_Time_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bided_Time_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Bided_Time_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bided_Time\" title=\"Bided Time\">Bided Time</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The tooltip for <b>Time Thoroughly Bided</b> does not mention that the wearer receives 2 turns of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Charge_(Condition)\" title=\"Arcane Charge (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Arcane_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Arcane_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Arcane_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Arcane_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Arcane_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Arcane_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Arcane Charge\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Arcane_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Arcane_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Arcane_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Charge_(Condition)\" title=\"Arcane Charge (Condition)\">Arcane Charge</a>, and any following hits merely reset its duration back to 2 turns.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Sacrifice\" title=\"Blood Sacrifice\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp/20px-Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp/30px-Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp/40px-Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blood Sacrifice\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp/20px-Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Blood_Sacrifice_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Sacrifice\" title=\"Blood Sacrifice\">Blood Sacrifice</a> or an attack made 